    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A roguelike puzzle adventure where you use random tools to tackle levels any way you can imagine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level can be completed in almost infinite ways and every tool and level element can interact with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See that gap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7b22c49fc044aab8ffda6bf53e1d5036.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7b22c49fc044aab8ffda6bf53e1d5036.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7b22c49fc044aab8ffda6bf53e1d5036.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a <strong>hookshot</strong> it's easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/72b81854db35df93ff858d2d7b6960f2.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/72b81854db35df93ff858d2d7b6960f2.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/72b81854db35df93ff858d2d7b6960f2.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or maybe you have a <strong>speed pad</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/70b699c0fb05b2451abf9f232e08bed2.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/70b699c0fb05b2451abf9f232e08bed2.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/70b699c0fb05b2451abf9f232e08bed2.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or perhaps you can <strong>make a platform movable</strong> and jump on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7896b288f2730efa54ea4d1c09323b40.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7896b288f2730efa54ea4d1c09323b40.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7896b288f2730efa54ea4d1c09323b40.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or build a bridge with <strong>glue and crates</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db3236ce2789cdce82b27acd906f93a6.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db3236ce2789cdce82b27acd906f93a6.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db3236ce2789cdce82b27acd906f93a6.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On every run you will unlock, buy and find new tools to use in that run. Everything works with everything: <strong>find YOUR creative solutions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6ebd1108ddb3064923af186047fd975b.avif?t=1755106364\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 20XX, a massive asteroid hurtles toward Earth\u2014only to stop, hovering above the planet. Within its core lies a wealth of rare materials, sparking a global mining operation that has been extracting resources for 25 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as Gustav, a seasoned worker selected for a high-stakes mission</strong>. A strange signal emanates from deep within the asteroid, and a team is sent to investigate. But as you descend into the heart of the asteroid, reality begins to warp. Time and space bend, and your team vanishes, leaving you alone. With no way to return, your only option is to push forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach the core and uncover the mystery of the asteroid, or be lost forever in its depths?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/2008bfa540eb6a7308a2ebfaea33d95d.avif?t=1755106364\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db1dd42da16206a3a76f64c8941a7c5c.avif?t=1755106364\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong>: Each run is unique, challenging you to adapt your strategy. Will you rush for the exit, or take the time to gather powerful tools to tackle tougher levels?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ handmade levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ tools</strong> to interact with the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>???+ narrative vignettes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/5613ae71f1c6ecff80ed60bf0b5a7300.avif?t=1755106364\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A roguelike puzzle adventure where you use random tools to tackle levels any way you can imagine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level can be completed in almost infinite ways and every tool and level element can interact with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See that gap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7b22c49fc044aab8ffda6bf53e1d5036.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7b22c49fc044aab8ffda6bf53e1d5036.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7b22c49fc044aab8ffda6bf53e1d5036.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a <strong>hookshot</strong> it's easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/72b81854db35df93ff858d2d7b6960f2.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/72b81854db35df93ff858d2d7b6960f2.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/72b81854db35df93ff858d2d7b6960f2.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or maybe you have a <strong>speed pad</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/70b699c0fb05b2451abf9f232e08bed2.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/70b699c0fb05b2451abf9f232e08bed2.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/70b699c0fb05b2451abf9f232e08bed2.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or perhaps you can <strong>make a platform movable</strong> and jump on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7896b288f2730efa54ea4d1c09323b40.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7896b288f2730efa54ea4d1c09323b40.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/7896b288f2730efa54ea4d1c09323b40.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or build a bridge with <strong>glue and crates</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db3236ce2789cdce82b27acd906f93a6.poster.avif?t=1755106364\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db3236ce2789cdce82b27acd906f93a6.webm?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db3236ce2789cdce82b27acd906f93a6.mp4?t=1755106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On every run you will unlock, buy and find new tools to use in that run. Everything works with everything: <strong>find YOUR creative solutions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6ebd1108ddb3064923af186047fd975b.avif?t=1755106364\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 20XX, a massive asteroid hurtles toward Earth\u2014only to stop, hovering above the planet. Within its core lies a wealth of rare materials, sparking a global mining operation that has been extracting resources for 25 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as Gustav, a seasoned worker selected for a high-stakes mission</strong>. A strange signal emanates from deep within the asteroid, and a team is sent to investigate. But as you descend into the heart of the asteroid, reality begins to warp. Time and space bend, and your team vanishes, leaving you alone. With no way to return, your only option is to push forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach the core and uncover the mystery of the asteroid, or be lost forever in its depths?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/2008bfa540eb6a7308a2ebfaea33d95d.avif?t=1755106364\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db1dd42da16206a3a76f64c8941a7c5c.avif?t=1755106364\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong>: Each run is unique, challenging you to adapt your strategy. Will you rush for the exit, or take the time to gather powerful tools to tackle tougher levels?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ handmade levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ tools</strong> to interact with the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>???+ narrative vignettes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/5613ae71f1c6ecff80ed60bf0b5a7300.avif?t=1755106364\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "There's Nothing Underground is a roguelike puzzle adventure where you use random tools to solve levels in endless ways. Unlock and combine tools to tackle 100+ levels, each with unique challenges. Find creative solutions, uncover the asteroid's secrets, and survive!",
